<trans-unit id="s32c49edb048874a7">
  <source>Arrow keys move between letters. Enter or Space marks the first letter of a word and, after moving, its last letter. Escape cancels.</source><target>Tumia vitufe vya mishale kusogea kati ya herufi. Enter au Space huweka alama kwenye herufi ya kwanza ya neno na, baada ya kusogea, herufi yake ya mwisho. Escape hughairi.</target>
</trans-unit>
<trans-unit id="scc1c5a630594c265">
  <source>Type a letter to fill the cell. Arrow keys move, Space changes direction, Tab jumps to the next clue, Escape leaves the grid.</source><target>Andika herufi ili kujaza kisanduku. Mishale husogeza, Space hubadilisha mwelekeo, Tab huenda kwenye kidokezo kinachofuata na Escape hutoka kwenye gridi.</target>
</trans-unit>
