</trans-unit>
<trans-unit id="sa7a3ac4919cb2c6d">
  <source>Place the words on a new grid? The current layout is replaced.</source><target>Uweke maneno kwenye gridi mpya? Mpangilio wa sasa utabadilishwa.</target>
